(Most Respectfully Showeth:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. That the applicant is the bona fide victim of a cyber fraud incident occurring on 26/8/2026, wherein an amount of) Tj
T* (Rs. 85,500 was fraudulently debited via UTR 312345678901.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. That pursuant to the prompt complaint filed on the National Cyber Crime Reporting Portal \(NCRP 1930\), the) Tj
T* (stolen funds have been successfully traced and frozen in the suspect account \(987654321000\) by the concerned) Tj
T* (bank nodal officer.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. That the said funds are the legitimate, hard-earned money of the applicant and are not required for any further) Tj
T* (physical forensic examination by the Investigating Officer as the transaction trail is entirely digital and preserved in) Tj
T* (bank logs.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4. That the applicant undertakes to furnish an indemnity bond/surety to the satisfaction of this Hon'ble Court if) Tj
T* (required.) Tj
